}

docs {
  # List All ASH Registrations
  
  Returns a paginated list of ASH student registrations. Results can be filtered by approval status and sorted by various fields. Supports full-text search via PostgreSQL GIN index.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Default     | Description / Allowed Values                                                                                                      |
  |-----------|--------|----------|-------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | page      | number | No       | `1`         | Page number (integer ≥ 1)                                                                                                         |
  | limit     | number | No       | `25`        | Items per page (integer, 1–100)                                                                                                   |
  | orderBy   | string | No       | `desc`      | Sort direction. One of: `asc`, `desc`                                                                                             |
  | status    | string | No       | `pending`   | One of: `accepted`, `rejected`, `pending`                                                                                         |
  | sortBy    | string | No       | `createdAt` | One of: `firstName`, `surname`, `createdAt`, `schoolState`, `assignedMentor`, `currentClass`, `gender`                            |
  | search    | string | No       | —           | Full-text search query. When provided, cache and sort/status filters are bypassed and results are matched against the GIN index.   |
  
  ### Searchable Fields
  
  | Field             | Weight |
  |-------------------|--------|
  | `firstName`       | A      |
  | `surname`         | A      |
  | `middleName`      | A      |
  | `currentClass`    | B      |
  | `assignedMentor`  | B      |
  | `schoolName`      | B      |
  | `schoolState`     | C      |
  | `schoolTown`      | C      |
  | `learningConditions` | C   |
  | `schoolLga`       | C      |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns a paginated array of ASH student registration records.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": [ ... ],
    "meta": {
      "pagination": {
        "page": 1,
        "limit": 25,
        "totalPages": 1
      }
    }
  }
  ```
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid query parameters (e.g. unknown `sortBy` key). |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                              |
}
